            <div xml:id="d144">

                <pb facs="0138" n="128" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg128"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/10–1349: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Special Assistant at Vatican City</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Gowen</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Vatican City</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-13">October 13,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received October 15—11:44 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>43. Deptel 18, October 11, re China.<anchor n="25" xml:id="d144-f1"/> Matter
                    mentioned by me to Montini, Vatican Under Secretary State, today. He said case
                    extremely serious and some days required for answer.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
